Thank you for supporting the beta of Elixir For Finance! In order to get started, you will need to
install Livebook. You can install Livebook by any of the methods outlined in the
[Install Livebook](https://livebook.dev/#install) or by running the following in the terminal:

```sh
$ mix local.rebar --force
$ mix local.hex --force
$ mix escript.install hex livebook
```

After you have Livebook installed on your system, you can start the Livebook server and open
up this document automatically by using the `start_livebook.sh` helper script found in the
`livebook_files` directory.

```sh
$ ./start_livebook.sh
```

## Livebook Files

Below is a listing of all of the Livebook files that come with this beta release along with a
short description of what is inside each document. More will arrive as later chapters land:

Chapter 1:

